{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05440","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 张嘉贞","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天锡我宗盟，元戎付夏卿。\n多才兼将相，必勇独横行。\n经纬称人杰，文章作代英。\n山川看是阵，草木想爲兵。\n不待河冰合，犹防塞月明。\n有谋当系丑，无战且绥氓。\n阃外传三略，云中冀一平。\n感恩同义激，怅别屡魂惊。\n直视前旌掣，遥闻後骑鸣。\n还期方定日，复此出郊迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张嘉贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}